# cargo-dejadoc

[![CI](https://github.com/LucaCappelletti94/cargo-dejadoc/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/LucaCappelletti94/cargo-dejadoc/actions/workflowsr#i.yml)
